{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46200","headline":"山居诗二十四首 十四 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岚嫩风轻似碧纱，雪楼金像隔烟霞。\n葛苞玉粉生香壠，菌簇银钉满净楂。\n举世只知嗟逝水，无人微解悟空花。\n可怜扰扰尘埃里，双鬓如银事似麻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46200.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46200","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}